---
title: "Sequence: Claim Posted Shift (UC-05)"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Employee
    participant SW as :SwapController
    participant RE as :RuleEngine
    participant SR as :SwapRequest
    Employee->>SW: claimShift(shiftId)
    SW->>RE: validateAssignment(shift, claimer)
    RE-->>SW: violations
    alt no blocking violation
        SW->>SR: setClaimed(claimer)
        SR-->>SW: ok
        SW-->>Employee: pending manager approval
    else blocking violation
        SW-->>Employee: refused, with the failing rule
    end
